{
  "$schema": "../../schema/markup.schema.json",
  "version": "1.0.0-rc.9",
  "id": "case-study",
  "kind": "view",
  "summary": "A case study, drawn by core's case-study view.",
  "root": {
    "element": "main",
    "attributes": {
      "id": "main",
      "tabindex": "-1"
    },
    "note": "Inside the document skeleton page.json draws once (section#landmarks)."
  },
  "elements": [
    {
      "role": "article",
      "element": "article",
      "classes": [
        "salt-case-study-view"
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "role": "header",
          "element": "header",
          "classes": [
            "salt-case-study-view__header"
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "role": "back",
              "element": "p",
              "classes": [
                "salt-case-study-view__back"
              ],
              "optional": true,
              "when": "the index has a safe href",
              "children": [
                {
                  "role": "back-link",
                  "element": "a",
                  "classes": [
                    "salt-case-study-view__back-link"
                  ],
                  "attributes": {
                    "href": "from:index.href"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "role": "title",
              "element": "h1",
              "text": "from:caseStudy.title"
            },
            {
              "role": "client",
              "element": "p",
              "classes": [
                "salt-case-study-view__client"
              ],
              "optional": true,
              "when": "client is set"
            },
            {
              "role": "summary",
              "element": "p",
              "classes": [
                "salt-case-study-view__summary"
              ],
              "optional": true,
              "when": "summary is set"
            },
            {
              "role": "results",
              "element": "ul",
              "classes": [
                "salt-grid",
                "salt-case-study-view__results"
              ],
              "attributes": {
                "role": "list",
                "aria-label": "from:labels.results",
                "data-columns": {
                  "enum": [
                    "2",
                    "4"
                  ],
                  "when": "two or fewer, or four or more"
                }
              },
              "optional": true,
              "when": "results are set",
              "children": [
                {
                  "role": "result",
                  "component": "stat",
                  "repeat": {
                    "from": "results"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "role": "details",
              "element": "dl",
              "classes": [
                "salt-case-study-view__details"
              ],
              "optional": true,
              "when": "details are set",
              "children": [
                {
                  "role": "detail",
                  "element": "div",
                  "classes": [
                    "salt-case-study-view__detail"
                  ],
                  "repeat": {
                    "from": "details"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "role": "detail-label",
                      "element": "dt",
                      "classes": [
                        "salt-case-study-view__detail-label"
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "role": "detail-value",
                      "element": "dd",
                      "classes": [
                        "salt-case-study-view__detail-value"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "role": "hero-media",
              "element": "div",
              "classes": [
                "salt-case-study-view__media"
              ],
              "optional": true,
              "when": "the featured image resolves",
              "note": "The hero image: the featured image, the header's last part, in either header variant. It is the view's priority image, the only one (section#priority-media).",
              "children": [
                {
                  "role": "hero-image",
                  "component": "media",
                  "note": "Priority; fill, cover."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "role": "challenge",
          "element": "section",
          "classes": [
            "salt-case-study-view__section"
          ],
          "optional": true,
          "when": "challenge is set",
          "children": [
            {
              "role": "challenge-heading",
              "element": "h2",
              "attributes": {
                "id": "case-study__challenge-heading"
              }
            },
            {
              "role": "challenge-body",
              "component": "rich-text-body"
            }
          ],
          "attributes": {
            "aria-labelledby": "case-study__challenge-heading"
          }
        },
        {
          "role": "flow-media",
          "element": "div",
          "classes": [
            "salt-case-study-view__flow-media"
          ],
          "optional": true,
          "when": "caseStudyImage resolves to a media item other than the featured image",
          "note": "The case-study image in the flow (SC-034): always after the challenge's place and before the solution's, so with no challenge it follows the header, and with no solution it comes before the gallery. It keeps that place when the challenge, the solution or the featured image is absent: it is never promoted to the hero, and nothing is drawn in its place when it is absent or does not resolve. When it resolves to the same media item as the featured image (the same media identity, such as the same WordPress attachment ID, never compared by alt text or file name), it is drawn once, in the hero, and not here.",
          "children": [
            {
              "role": "flow-image",
              "component": "media",
              "note": "Never the priority image, so lazy; fill, cover; its alt by the media's normal rules (media.json). No caption."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "role": "solution",
          "element": "section",
          "classes": [
            "salt-case-study-view__section"
          ],
          "optional": true,
          "when": "solution is set",
          "children": [
            {
              "role": "solution-heading",
              "element": "h2",
              "attributes": {
                "id": "case-study__solution-heading"
              }
            },
            {
              "role": "solution-body",
              "component": "rich-text-body"
            }
          ],
          "attributes": {
            "aria-labelledby": "case-study__solution-heading"
          }
        },
        {
          "role": "gallery",
          "element": "section",
          "classes": [
            "salt-case-study-view__section"
          ],
          "optional": true,
          "when": "gallery images are set",
          "children": [
            {
              "role": "gallery-heading",
              "element": "h2",
              "attributes": {
                "id": "case-study__gallery-heading"
              }
            },
            {
              "role": "gallery-list",
              "element": "ul",
              "classes": [
                "salt-grid"
              ],
              "attributes": {
                "role": "list"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "role": "gallery-item",
                  "element": "li",
                  "repeat": {
                    "from": "gallery"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "role": "frame",
                      "element": "div",
                      "classes": [
                        "salt-case-study-view__frame"
                      ],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "role": "frame-image",
                          "component": "media"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "attributes": {
            "aria-labelledby": "case-study__gallery-heading"
          }
        },
        {
          "role": "live",
          "element": "p",
          "classes": [
            "salt-case-study-view__live"
          ],
          "optional": true,
          "when": "the live url is safe",
          "children": [
            {
              "role": "live-link",
              "component": "button",
              "attributes": {
                "data-style": "secondary",
                "target": "_blank"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "role": "services",
          "element": "section",
          "classes": [
            "salt-case-study-view__section",
            "salt-case-study-view__services"
          ],
          "optional": true,
          "when": "services are linked",
          "children": [
            {
              "role": "services-heading",
              "element": "h2",
              "attributes": {
                "id": "case-study__services-heading"
              }
            },
            {
              "role": "services-list",
              "element": "ul",
              "classes": [
                "salt-grid",
                "salt-showcase"
              ],
              "attributes": {
                "role": "list",
                "data-layout": "grid"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "role": "service-item",
                  "element": "li",
                  "repeat": {
                    "from": "services"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "role": "service-card",
                      "component": "card",
                      "note": "Generic style, title at h3; never the priority image."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "attributes": {
            "aria-labelledby": "case-study__services-heading"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variants": [
    {
      "field": "header",
      "site": "caseStudy",
      "sameOrder": false,
      "options": {
        "band": {
          "elements": {
            "article": {
              "attributes": {
                "data-header": "band"
              }
            }
          },
          "replace": {
            "header": {
              "role": "header",
              "element": "header",
              "classes": [
                "salt-section",
                "salt-case-study-view__header"
              ],
              "attributes": {
                "data-tone": {
                  "enum": [
                    "surface",
                    "surface-alt",
                    "brand-tint",
                    "surface-inverse"
                  ],
                  "note": "site.caseStudy.headerTone"
                },
                "data-tone-dark": {
                  "enum": [
                    "surface",
                    "surface-alt",
                    "brand-tint",
                    "surface-inverse"
                  ],
                  "note": "site.caseStudy.headerToneDark, or the tone itself when that is unset, written server-side as a section's is."
                },
                "data-spacing": "md",
                "data-width": "default"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "role": "header-content",
                  "element": "div",
                  "classes": [
                    "salt-section__content"
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "role": "back",
                      "element": "p",
                      "classes": [
                        "salt-case-study-view__back"
                      ],
                      "optional": true,
                      "when": "the index has a safe href",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "role": "back-link",
                          "element": "a",
                          "classes": [
                            "salt-case-study-view__back-link"
                          ],
                          "attributes": {
                            "href": "from:index.href"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "role": "title",
                      "element": "h1",
                      "text": "from:caseStudy.title"
                    },
                    {
                      "role": "client",
                      "element": "p",
                      "classes": [
                        "salt-case-study-view__client"
                      ],
                      "optional": true,
                      "when": "client is set"
                    },
                    {
                      "role": "summary",
                      "element": "p",
                      "classes": [
                        "salt-case-study-view__summary"
                      ],
                      "optional": true,
                      "when": "summary is set"
                    },
                    {
                      "role": "results",
                      "element": "ul",
                      "classes": [
                        "salt-grid",
                        "salt-case-study-view__results"
                      ],
                      "attributes": {
                        "role": "list",
                        "aria-label": "from:labels.results",
                        "data-columns": {
                          "enum": [
                            "2",
                            "4"
                          ],
                          "when": "two or fewer, or four or more"
                        }
                      },
                      "optional": true,
                      "when": "results are set",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "role": "result",
                          "component": "stat",
                          "repeat": {
                            "from": "results"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "role": "details",
                      "element": "dl",
                      "classes": [
                        "salt-case-study-view__details"
                      ],
                      "optional": true,
                      "when": "details are set",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "role": "detail",
                          "element": "div",
                          "classes": [
                            "salt-case-study-view__detail"
                          ],
                          "repeat": {
                            "from": "details"
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "role": "detail-label",
                              "element": "dt",
                              "classes": [
                                "salt-case-study-view__detail-label"
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "role": "detail-value",
                              "element": "dd",
                              "classes": [
                                "salt-case-study-view__detail-value"
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "role": "hero-media",
                      "element": "div",
                      "classes": [
                        "salt-case-study-view__media"
                      ],
                      "optional": true,
                      "when": "the featured image resolves",
                      "note": "The hero image: the featured image, the header's last part, in either header variant. It is the view's priority image, the only one (section#priority-media).",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "role": "hero-image",
                          "component": "media",
                          "note": "Priority; fill, cover."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "note": "The header drawn as section.json draws a band, so the tone's roles, a site's rules for a band's measure and its full-bleed exemptions all reach it: salt-section with the tones, md spacing (which sections.css turns into the band's block space) and the default width, and its parts inside div.salt-section__content, the hero image last among them."
        }
      },
      "note": "plain draws the base tree. band wraps the header's parts in a content div, so the order differs from plain's."
    }
  ],
  "headings": {
    "provides": "always",
    "level": "fixed",
    "fixedLevel": 1,
    "rules": [
      "section#single-h1"
    ],
    "role": "title",
    "children": "section headings h2; their bodies from base 2"
  },
  "script": {
    "kind": "none"
  },
  "uses": [
    "stat",
    "media",
    "rich-text-body",
    "button",
    "card"
  ],
  "ruleRefs": [
    "section#landmarks",
    "section#single-h1"
  ],
  "hooks": [
    {
      "class": "salt-case-study-view__back",
      "role": "back",
      "reason": "The back link's paragraph; the link carries the rules."
    },
    {
      "class": "salt-case-study-view__detail",
      "role": "detail",
      "reason": "Groups each dt with its dd; the details grid styles the pair's parts."
    },
    {
      "class": "salt-case-study-view__header",
      "role": "header",
      "reason": "The header that holds the title, its lines and the hero image; the view's rules space its parts as children of it, and a band draws it through salt-section."
    },
    {
      "class": "salt-case-study-view__live",
      "role": "live",
      "reason": "The live-site link's paragraph; the button carries the rules."
    },
    {
      "class": "salt-case-study-view__section",
      "role": "challenge",
      "reason": "Each of the four content sections (challenge, solution, gallery, services); the view's rules space its heading and parts as children of it, and it has no rule of its own."
    },
    {
      "class": "salt-case-study-view__services",
      "role": "services",
      "reason": "Tells the delivered services' section from the other three; the section's rules come from salt-case-study-view__section's children and the grid."
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    {
      "topic": "ruling",
      "text": "This view's vocabulary is core's and fixed here, because primitives.css styles it."
    },
    {
      "topic": "stylesheet-only",
      "text": "primitives.css mentions .salt-case-study only in a comment (a site's own older copy); it is not contract vocabulary."
    },
    {
      "topic": "ruling",
      "text": "The hero and the flow (SC-034). The featured image is the hero image, drawn last in the header, inside the band's content when the header is a band, and it is the view's only priority image. caseStudyImage is a separate optional image, drawn in the flow between the challenge and the solution and never the priority image. Neither is ever drawn in the other's place, neither leaves an empty wrapper, and one media item is never drawn twice. The image aside goes: no image runs beside the view's parts, and nothing in the markup counts them. Only the image aside is removed; this does not rule out a separate sidebar of related details (such as the case study's sector, client and services), whose fields and presentation are not yet settled, so the contract draws none and fixes nothing about one."
    }
  ],
  "platforms": {
    "wordpress": {
      "formerly": [
        {
          "role": "root",
          "element": "main",
          "note": "single-work.php"
        }
      ],
      "owes": [
        "The case-study view's markup above.",
        "The featured image drawn in the header, last, as the priority image, and caseStudyImage (an attachment ID) drawn in div.salt-case-study-view__flow-media between the challenge and the solution, lazy, and not at all when it is the featured image's attachment (SC-034). No data-media or data-aside-rows on the article.",
        "The section heading ids case-study__challenge-heading, case-study__solution-heading, case-study__gallery-heading and case-study__services-heading, each named by its section's aria-labelledby (SC-012).",
        "An ACF options page on which editors set the case-study view's header band (the header variant, plain or band, with the band's tone and dark tone), the settings a fixture gives as site.caseStudy: header, headerTone and headerToneDark. The image aside layout setting goes (SC-034)."
      ]
    },
    "nextjs": {
      "owes": [
        "The featured image drawn in the header, last, as the priority image, and caseStudyImage drawn in div.salt-case-study-view__flow-media between the challenge and the solution, lazy, and not at all when it is the featured image's media item; the media prop and its image aside layout go, with data-media, the aside rows and the measure (SC-034).",
        "The header band's spacing from data-spacing alone, with no inline --salt-section-space (SC-029).",
        "Name its four sections: the ids case-study__challenge-heading, case-study__solution-heading, case-study__gallery-heading and case-study__services-heading on their h2s, and aria-labelledby on each section (section#labelled-by, SC-012).",
        "A delivered service's card image declares its slot from contract/image-sizes.json, at three columns, the grid it is drawn in: the card slot in the full band; case-study-view.tsx passes the unbanded card slot, which is a carousel slide's."
      ]
    }
  },
  "priorityMedia": {
    "role": "hero-image",
    "when": "the featured image resolves",
    "rules": [
      "section#priority-media"
    ]
  }
}
